247
00:20:05.038 --> 00:20:06.290
Okay.

248
00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:11.378
Uh-uh-uh. Not yet.

249
00:20:11.461 --> 00:20:13.297
Now.

250
00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.631
